{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22394","headline":"村居卧病三首 二 · 白居易","name":"村居卧病三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新秋久病客，起步村南道。\n尽日不逢人，虫声徧荒草。\n西风吹白露，野绿秋仍早。\n草木犹爲伤，先伤我怀抱。\n朱颜与玄鬓，强健几时好。\n况爲忧病侵，不得依年老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}